#: gui/dialogs/qmessagebox.cpp:1649
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<h3>About Qt</h3>%1<p>Qt is a C++ toolkit for cross-platform application "
"development.</p><p>Qt provides single-source portability across MS&nbsp;"
"Windows, Mac&nbsp;OS&nbsp;X, Linux, and all major commercial Unix variants. "
"Qt is also available for embedded devices as Qtopia Core.</p><p>Qt is a "
"Trolltech product. See <a href=\"http://www.trolltech.com/qt/\">www."
"trolltech.com/qt/</a> for more information.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Åd fwait di Qt</h3>%1<p>Qt est ene boesse ås usteyes pol disvelopmint d' "
"programes so sacwants sistinmes d' operances.</p><p>Qt vos dene li "
"poirtåvisté a pårti d' on seu sourdant po MS&nbsp;Windows, Mac&nbsp;OS&nbsp;"
"X, Linux et totes les mwaisse diferins recwårlants UNIX. Qt est ossu "
"disponibe po des ravalés éndjins come Qtopia Core.</p><p>Qt est on prodût da "
"Trolltech. Veyoz <a href=\"http://www.trolltech.com/qt/\">www.trolltech.com/"
"qt/</a> po pus d' informåcions.</p>"

#: gui/dialogs/qmessagebox.cpp:1660
#, qt-format
msgid "<p>This program uses Qt version %1.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Ci programe eploye li modêye %1 di Qt.</p>"

#: gui/dialogs/qmessagebox.cpp:1662
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<p>This program uses Qt Open Source Edition version %1.</p><p>Qt Open Source "
"Edition is intended for the development of Open Source applications. You "
"need a commercial Qt license for development of proprietary (closed source) "
"applications.</p><p>Please see <a href=\"http://www.trolltech.com/company/"
"model/\">www.trolltech.com/company/model/</a> for an overview of Qt "
"licensing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ci programe eploye li modêye %1 do Libe Eplaidaedje di Qt.</p><p>Li Libe "
"Eplaidaedje di Qt est fwaite pol disvelopmint di libes programes. Vos avoz "
"dandjî d' ene recwårlante licince Qt pol disvelopmint d' propiyetaires "
"programes (clôjhous sourdants).</p><p>Veyoz, s' i vs plait, <a href=\"http://"
"www.trolltech.com/company/model/\">www.trolltech.com/company/model/</a> po "
"ene esplikêye des licinces di Qt.</p>"

